---
import {STORAGE_REGIONS,STORAGE_COUNTRIES} from '../lib/storage-onboarding.mjs';
const {isOwner=false,userKey}=Astro.props;
---
<section class="settings-section storage-onboarding" data-onboarding-owner={userKey} aria-labelledby="onboarding-heading"><div class="onboarding-heading"><h2 id="onboarding-heading">Find your storage</h2><span>Guided setup</span></div><p>Connect storage you already own, or plan a service in your preferred country. This guide does not change your active connection or move files.</p><details id="storage-setup-guide"><summary>Choose a location & connect storage</summary><form id="storage-location-form"><h3>1. Where would you prefer your files?</h3><div class="onboarding-fields"><label>Preferred region<select id="storage-region" name="region">{Object.entries(STORAGE_REGIONS).map(([value,label])=><option value={value}>{label}</option>)}</select></label><label>Preferred country<select id="storage-country" name="country" data-countries={JSON.stringify(STORAGE_COUNTRIES)}><option value="">Not specified / country not listed</option></select></label></div><label>Location requirement<select id="storage-location-scope" name="scope"><option value="files-at-rest">Provider file location</option><option value="residency-review">I need a full data-residency review</option></select></label><p class="onboarding-note">These choices record your preference, not a verified storage location. Country examples do not mean a compatible provider is available.</p><button type="submit" class="btn ghost" id="storage-location-save" disabled>Save planning preference</button><p id="storage-location-status" role="status">Loading your planning preference…</p><p id="storage-residency-note" hidden>A full review includes file processing, metadata, keys, logs and backups. The current website relay and hosted account services are not guaranteed to be in your chosen country. This option does not enable a regional-only service.</p></form><section class="onboarding-step"><h3>2. Choose your next step</h3><label>Storage account<select id="storage-setup-path"><option value="existing">I already have storage</option><option value="choose">Help me choose a service</option></select></label><div id="storage-provider-guide" hidden><p id="storage-region-guidance">Choose a host that confirms the country for your specific plan, including backups and processing.</p><div class="provider-options"><article><h4>Hosted Nextcloud</h4><p>Choose an independent host or your own server with HTTPS WebDAV. Confirm its data location and sync compatibility.</p><a href="https://nextcloud.com/providers/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore Nextcloud providers (new tab) →</a></article><article><h4>kDrive / other WebDAV storage</h4><p>Use a supported WebDAV endpoint from your provider. Confirm the location for your account and plan directly.</p><a href="https://www.infomaniak.com/en/kdrive" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">kDrive information (new tab) →</a></article></div><p class="onboarding-note">Provider pages open separately; no account or paid plan is created here. Availability, terms and prices need checking with the provider. Switzerland is in Europe, not the EU.</p><details><summary>What to check before choosing</summary><ul><li>Primary storage country, backups and subprocessors.</li><li>Where files are processed, and where account metadata and logs go.</li><li>Storage/download costs, export options and account recovery.</li><li>Supported WebDAV access and safe conditional writes.</li></ul></details></div><label>Connection type<select id="storage-connection-kind"><option value="webdav">WebDAV — I have the full folder URL</option><option value="nextcloud">Nextcloud — help me prepare the folder URL</option></select></label><div id="nextcloud-url-helper" hidden><p>In Nextcloud, Files → Settings normally provides your WebDAV URL. You can copy that directly below. This helper builds the usual URL when you know the server address and account ID; your host may use a different setup.</p><label>Nextcloud server address<input id="nextcloud-server" type="url" placeholder="https://cloud.example.com/nextcloud/" autocomplete="off" maxlength="1500"/></label><label>Nextcloud account ID<input id="nextcloud-account" autocomplete="off" maxlength="200" placeholder="Your account ID may differ from your email"/></label><button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="nextcloud-build-url">Prepare folder URL</button><label>Suggested WebDAV folder URL<input id="nextcloud-generated-url" readonly autocomplete="off"/></label><button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="nextcloud-copy-url" disabled>Copy folder URL</button><p id="nextcloud-helper-status" role="status"></p></div><p>Use an app password issued by your provider in Connection details. Credentials are entered in the connection form, not saved with your location preference. New provider hosts need administrator approval.</p><button type="button" class="btn" id="storage-open-connection">Open connection details</button><p class="onboarding-note">This opens the existing form without replacing its values. There is one WebDAV connection slot today; saving different details replaces that connection. Back up unsynced work before changing it.</p></section><section class="onboarding-step"><h3>3. Test before syncing</h3><ol><li>Complete <strong>Test & save</strong> in Connection details. It writes and removes a temporary file.</li><li>Run <strong>Test Kōbō sync connection</strong> for conditional saves, metadata, read-back and safe deletion.</li><li>Choose a verified active provider only when you intend to use it. This does not migrate your libraries; reopen apps to use the selected connection.</li></ol><p>Connection checks do not complete the app’s two-device and original-file acceptance tests. Existing write gates and read-only outcomes still apply.</p></section><details class="onboarding-step"><summary>Google Drive, Google Docs, Proton & regional S3</summary><p>Google Drive connects through its section below. Google Docs is a separate editor/native document workflow; a Drive connection does not promise country selection or direct editing of Google-native documents.</p><p>Proton Drive and region-selected S3 are under assessment. There is no new direct connection for either here yet. Their supported authorization, encryption and safe-write requirements need review.</p></details>{isOwner&&<details class="onboarding-step"><summary>Administrator: approve a new WebDAV host</summary><p>Review the provider and exact public HTTPS hostname before adding it to <code>WEBDAV_ALLOWED_HOSTS</code> in Netlify Functions / Production. Preserve existing hostnames, use no wildcards, then redeploy. Keep <code>FILE_STORAGE_ENCRYPTION_KEY</code> unchanged. Existing public-address, TLS, redirect and sync-safety checks remain required.</p></details>}</details></section>
<script>import '../scripts/storage-onboarding';</script>
<style>.onboarding-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.onboarding-heading>span{font-size:11px;opacity:.7}.storage-onboarding summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:13px}.storage-onboarding h3{margin:12px 0}.storage-onboarding label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin:12px 0;min-width:0}.onboarding-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.storage-onboarding input,.storage-onboarding select{width:100%;min-width:0;font-size:16px}.storage-onboarding button{min-height:44px;font-size:12px;margin:4px 0}.storage-onboarding [role=status],.storage-onboarding .onboarding-note{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.onboarding-step{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:12px;margin-top:14px}.storage-onboarding li{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:8px}.storage-onboarding ul,.storage-onboarding ol{padding-left:20px}.provider-options{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.provider-options article{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:12px;min-width:0}.provider-options h4{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 6px}.provider-options p{font-size:12px}.provider-options a{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}.storage-onboarding code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:600px){.onboarding-fields,.provider-options{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}.provider-options{gap:10px}}.storage-onboarding [hidden]{display:none!important}</style>
